              formal: "💬 **Question**: Handling a critical bug right before a release\n\n---\n\n⭐️ **Answer**:\n- Assess severity, impact, and blast radius immediately\n- Escalate to stakeholders to evaluate release delay vs hotfix risk\n- Implement fix in isolation, run targeted tests, and deploy post-release if low risk"
