              formal: "💬 **Question**: Handling a critical bug right before a release\n\n---\n\n⭐️ **Answer**:\n- Assess severity, impact, and user risk immediately\n- Evaluate patch complexity against remaining release window\n- Consult engineering lead, product manager, and QA on options\n- Weigh fast hotfix versus postponing the deployment window\n- Implement automated test coverage for the regression scenario\n- Document root cause and add post-mortem action items"
