              formal: "💬 **Question**: Difference between HTML and CSS\n\n---\n\n⭐️ **Answer**:\n- HTML structures content with semantic tags and elements\n- CSS styles layout, colors, fonts, and responsiveness\n- HTML builds skeleton, CSS applies visual presentation layer"
