              formal: "💬 **Question**: Difference between HTML and CSS\n\n---\n\n⭐️ **Answer**:\n- Defines page structure and semantic content\n- Uses tags for elements like headings and paragraphs\n- Controls visual styling, layout, and responsiveness\n- Applies rules to elements using selectors and properties\n- Separates presentation from content for maintainability"
