              formal: "💬 **Question**: Tell me about yourself.\n\n---\n\n⭐️ **Answer**: I am a Software Engineer with a strong background in building and maintaining scalable backend services and responsive web front ends. Throughout my career, I've focused on writing clean, maintainable code, optimizing system performance, and collaborating closely with cross-functional teams to deliver robust features from end to end. I enjoy tackling complex architectural challenges, improving developer tooling, and ensuring seamless integration between APIs and user interfaces. I'm excited about this role because it allows me to combine my backend expertise with my frontend experience to build high-impact products."
