              formal: "💬 **Question**: Tell me about yourself.\n\n---\n\n⭐️ **Answer**: I'm a software engineer with strong experience building and maintaining backend services and web front ends. In my recent roles, I've focused on designing scalable APIs, integrating robust backend logic with modern user interfaces, and ensuring seamless communication across the full stack. I enjoy tackling complex architectural challenges and am excited to bring my technical background to this team."
